{"unit_id":"PandaBoby__dsh-rea#card-zh","repo":"PandaBoby/dsh-rea","commit":"15b6eb3af1626b59c919c78ab583b99076cb077e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rea 是一个把 REA（Reverse Engineer Anything）MCP 服务接入 DeepSeek Harness 的插件 bundle。它向 DSH 插入名为 rea-mcp 的 MCP 客户端配置，使用 stdio 启动 rea-agents，并将发现的工具放入 rea 命名空间；用户可在插件页开关整个连接。启用时可调用 REA 服务提供的工具，关闭后撤下连接。适合需要在 DSH 会话中使用 REA 工具的用户。这个包本身只声明连接，不包含 REA 分析引擎或工具实现；启用后由 npx 获取 rea-agents。","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:21-24","cordis.patch.yml:19-29"]}
{"unit_id":"PandaBoby__dsh-rea#card-en","repo":"PandaBoby/dsh-rea","commit":"15b6eb3af1626b59c919c78ab583b99076cb077e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-rea connects the REA MCP server to DSH through a toggleable bundle. It inserts an stdio client that launches rea-agents and exposes its discovered tools in the rea namespace. The package declares this connection but does not implement the REA tools.","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:21-24","cordis.patch.yml:19-29"]}
